## Layout

- `scripts/` holds the toolchain helpers, with their tests beside them as
  `scripts/test_<script>.py`. There is no first-party package and no Python interop; do not add
  either. Logic belongs in Rust.
- pytest collects `scripts/` with `--doctest-modules`, so every module there is imported at
  collection and every docstring example runs.
- `[project.dependencies]` stays empty: nothing imports it. Dev tools go in the `dev` group.
